# 🧠 Text-Guided Defect Segmentation

This repository implements a complete pipeline for **text-conditioned industrial defect segmentation**, focusing on:

* Drywall joints
* Surface cracks

It progresses from **zero-shot foundation models** to a **highly optimized cascaded architecture**:

> **Fine-tuned YOLO-World + Custom YOLO-Seg**

---

## 📑 Table of Contents

* [Architecture Overview](#-architecture-overview)
* [Setup and Installation](#-setup-and-installation)
* [Dataset Preparation](#-dataset-preparation)
* [Training Pipeline](#-training-pipeline)
* [Evaluation and Inference](#-evaluation-and-inference)

---

## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

The final solution uses a **Text-Guided Cascaded Pipeline**:

### 🔹 Stage 1 — Detection (YOLO-World)

* Input: image + natural language prompt
  *(e.g., "segment crack", "drywall joint")*
* Output: **precise bounding boxes** for relevant defects

---

### 🔹 Stage 2 — Segmentation (YOLO-Seg)

* A **custom-trained segmentation model**
* Uses bounding boxes from Stage 1 as a **strict spatial filter**
* Produces **pixel-level masks aligned with the text query**

---

### 🎯 Key Idea

```text
Text → Region (YOLO-World) → Pixels (YOLO-Seg)
```

This cascade improves:

* Localization accuracy
* Semantic alignment
* Robustness to noisy annotations

---

## ⚙️ Setup and Installation

> ⚠️ Requires CUDA-enabled system (CUDA 11.8+ recommended)

---

### 🔹 Install PyTorch

```bash
pip install torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118
```

---

### 🔹 Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install ultralytics opencv-python numpy pycocotools tqdm pyyaml
```

---

### 🔹 Install Segment Anything (for baselines)

```bash
pip install git+https://github.com/facebookresearch/segment-anything.git
```

---

### 🔹 Download SAM Weights

```bash
mkdir -p weights
wget -O weights/sam_vit_h_4b8939.pth \
https://dl.fbaipublicfiles.com/segment_anything/sam_vit_h_4b8939.pth
```

---

## 📦 Dataset Preparation

### 🔹 Input Format

* Original datasets: **COCO JSON format**
* Location:

```
data/
 ├── drywall_join/
 └── cracks/
```

---

### 🔹 Convert to YOLO Format

Run:

```bash
python -m utils.convert_data_combined
python -m utils.convert_yolo_seg
```

---

### 🔹 Output

* Unified dataset: `data/yolo_seg_dataset/`
* Config file: `data.yaml`

---

## 🏋️ Training Pipeline

The cascaded system requires **domain-specific fine-tuning** to handle:

* Localization failures
* Annotation inconsistencies

---

### 🔹 1. Train YOLO-World (Detector)

Fine-tune the text-conditioned detector:

```bash
python -m pipelines.train_yolo
```

---

### 🔹 2. Train YOLO-Seg (Segmenter)

Train segmentation model on full-resolution data:

```bash
python -m pipelines.train_yolo_seg
```

---

## 📊 Evaluation and Inference

The evaluation pipeline:

* Computes:

  * **mIoU**
  * **mDice**
* Applies:

  * Morphological dilation (to correct GT bias)
* Outputs:

  * Binary masks
  * CSV logs

---

### 🔹 Run Full Evaluation

```bash
python -m evaluation.evaluate_trained_yoloworld
```

---

### 📁 Outputs

```
evaluation/
 ├── rubric_masks/        # PNG masks for evaluation
 └── detailed_results.csv # Per-image metrics
```

---

### 🔹 Run Inference

```bash
python -m pipelines.main
```

---

